<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian stocks seen marking time, await RBA.</title>
<headline>Australian stocks seen marking time, await RBA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------(Snapshot 8.45 a.m./2245 GMT)-----------------</p>
<p>AORD cl	   2725.90  +23.50   DJIA  cl	7672.79  -14.93</p>
<p>SPI Sycom cl	 2760	-6   US 30yr cl	 6.79   +0.05</p>
<p>10yrbond futs    92.910  -0.010   Gold NY 333.95 Lon fix 334.55</p>
<p>AUD	   0.7545 (Mon 0.7453)   CRB Index cl   239.42   +0.09</p>
<p>NIKKEI cl	20604.96  +81.21   FTSE cl	 4604.60  -35.70</p>
<p>S&amp;P500(Globex)   890.50   +0.25   NZSE40	  2486.77  -15.20</p>
<p>--------------------------(July 1)-----------------------------</p>
<p>*Stocks seen narrowly traded as market awaits Reserve Bank meeting outcome. &quot;We'll just sit on the back step today and wait for an announcement tomorrow,&quot; said a senior Sydney dealer.</p>
</text>
